    "PaperRss 专为沉浸式阅读打造。在保持纸张排版美感的同时，提供舒适的长文阅读体验。字号调整会同步到所有文章。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"PaperRss is built for focused reading, combining paper-inspired typography with a comfortable long-form experience. Text size changes apply to every article."}}}},
