    "首次打开尚无摘要的文章时自动生成；已有缓存不会重复请求。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Generate a summary the first time an uncached article is opened. Cached summaries are reused."}}}},
    "保持手动模式，只在你点击“生成摘要”后请求模型。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stay in manual mode and contact the model only after you click Generate Summary."}}}},
    "自定义指令会附加在系统默认 Prompt 之后（例如：“请用通俗易懂的口语解释”或“侧重分析工程实现细节”）。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Custom instructions are appended to the built-in prompt—for example, ask for plain language or an engineering-focused explanation."}}}},
    "仅在服务商明确支持时生效；翻译和划词解释会自动关闭推理。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Used only when explicitly supported by the provider. Translation and selection explanations disable reasoning automatically."}}}},
    "每次打开或回到前台时，PaperRss 会立即检查所有订阅。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"PaperRss checks every feed when it opens or returns to the foreground."}}}},
